WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.250 line:91%
Chapter 18. For students. Listening, and word cards.

00:00:05.658 --> 00:00:09.011 line:91%
Your teacher starts a listening. Tap your name.

00:00:12.108 --> 00:00:18.371 line:91%
At the top, you see your level: Starter, Explorer or Champion. Your help follows your level.

00:00:18.823 --> 00:00:27.011 line:91%
Before you listen, look at the key words. Tap a word: read the meaning and the example. At home, tap the speaker to listen.

00:00:29.524 --> 00:00:31.952 line:91%
Then guess: what will you hear?

00:00:33.486 --> 00:00:38.211 line:91%
Listen to the speakers, and answer the question about the main idea.

00:00:39.194 --> 00:00:49.772 line:91%
Then listen again, and answer the details. In class, your phone is quiet. Want to hear it again? Tap "Play it again, please". Your teacher plays it for everyone.

00:00:52.878 --> 00:01:00.071 line:91%
Check: see your answers. Tap "Hear it": it plays the part with the answer. The text lights up while you listen.

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:05.930 line:91%
Dictation: tap "Listen", type the sentence, and send. You have one try.

00:01:07.995 --> 00:01:12.811 line:91%
Red words are missing or wrong. Read the right sentence, and say it.

00:01:13.275 --> 00:01:17.892 line:91%
Last, speak with a partner. Then write, and send it to your teacher.

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:29.711 line:91%
At the bottom, "Word cards" has all the new words of the unit. At home, play "Quick check": read the meaning, and find the word.

00:01:30.175 --> 00:01:37.292 line:91%
In reading texts, words with a line under them open a card too. Tap, read, and listen. Well done!
